    "message": "Merge PR #123: exact finite ensemble marker counts and horizon bounds\n\nIntegrate the independently reviewed head after a fresh 16-module trust-zero build, complete semantic and axiom review, preserved historical evidence, and final current-main tree/source identity checks.\n\nReviewed head: 0d1eea6c69078111366d9d7235bd47c3e16aadf8\nVerified base: a38b83ec83b74ad046207c5848ec05d39a878cfb\nVerified combination tree: 2d681007df7138fd4365aa323ab30771eeb5660e\nIndependent review: 5554677798\nEvidence: bf6f18cfbcee5913ce7243e5a08fe8aac28d3718\n\nThe result is an exact canonical marker-complement count and its stated finite positive-time palindrome-hit upper bound; no infinite avoidance or 196 conclusion is asserted. Preserve both parents and all prior main entries.",
